23
00:01:39,962 --> 00:01:43,526
attached tool, and open the conversation created through its

24
00:01:43,596 --> 00:01:47,079
API. The request asks the agent to load the

25
00:01:47,137 --> 00:01:51,398
AKS known-issues skill, read the error-code catalog and the

26
