not a live Azure incident investigation. The skills are

33
00:02:22,164 --> 00:02:26,832
versioned guidance. In the workplace design, their source is

34
00:02:26,901 --> 00:02:32,277
GitLab, and the runtime consumes the approved release. This

35
00:02:32,346 --> 00:02:36,944
home-lab content source is separate. Guidance explains how to

36
00:02:37,025 --> 00:02:41,576
work; the tool binding and backend permissions determine what

37
00:02:41,634 --> 00:02:45,802
the agent can actually access. The MCP service runs

38
00:02:45,872 --> 00:02:49,402
