39
00:02:49,436 --> 00:02:55,184
operation. Next, open the OpenTelemetry workflow view. Select the

40
00:02:55,242 --> 00:02:59,665
recorded request and follow the runtime, model, skill and

41
00:02:59,711 --> 00:03:04,878
MCP activity. The runtime reports three model calls and

42
00:03:04,924 --> 00:03:10,068
