44
00:03:13,725 --> 00:03:19,855
outcome; the trace provides the observed operations. Two HTTP

45
00:03:20,168 --> 00:03:24,812
discovery requests returned 404, so the viewer marks the

46
00:03:24,858 --> 00:03:29,154
trace with errors even though the task completed. That

47
00:03:29,224 --> 00:03:34,286
distinction matters during diagnosis. For the security boundary, an

48
00:03:34,367 --> 00:03:38,895
unauthenticated request to the separate protected MCP route returns

49
00:03:38,976 --> 00:03:44,770
HTTP 401. That proves this route rejects the request.

50
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:48,346
It does not prove Entra identity enforcement for our

51
00:03:48,392 --> 00:03:53,745
recording agent, or every network-isolation boundary. Finally, open the

52
00:03:53,814 --> 00:03:58,795
Entra administration pages for agent blueprints and agent identities.

53
00:03:59,399 --> 00:04:03,660
The intended identity design separates the calling application's access

54
00:04:03,706 --> 00:04:06,504
to the agent from the agent's own access to

55
00:04:06,585 --> 00:04:12,332
an MCP API. The target audience, approved identity and

56
00:04:12,402 --> 00:04:17,406
required permissions must match the destination. This runtime recording

57
00:04:17,789 --> 00:04:20,482
does not claim that an Entra token exchange took

58
00:04:20,540 --> 00:04:26,067
place. The central registry brings ownership, reviewed versions, approved

59
00:04:26,137 --> 00:04:32,325
connections and acceptance evidence together. Registration supports governance; the

60
00:04:32,383 --> 00:04:36,922
evidence establishes which checks passed. That is the agent

61
00:04:36,980 --> 00:04:42,390
journey we are making consumable: declare an approved agent,

62
00:04:42,716 --> 00:04:47,000
run it behind explicit boundaries, call its API, and

63
00:04:47,058 --> 00:04:51,853
inspect what it actually did. The reusable delivery contract,

64
00:04:52,166 --> 00:04:56,624
running interface, skill and tool records, gateway and observability

65
00:04:56,682 --> 00:05:00,978
